	(text "GP0-7 = OUT1, GP8-15 = OUT2: two runs of eight consecutive pins,\none PIO state machine each in the PicoLEDs renderer.\nGP16/17 = debug UART (UART0), GP20/21 = I2C0.\nGP23-25 and GP29 are the Pico's own (radio, LED, VSYS sense).\nUSB, BOOTSEL, SWD and the LED are on the Pico. SW1 pulls RUN low to reset it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 259.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "111d50c0-68f9-5f63-bbc1-d1ce986b92fa")
	)
	(text "Output shrouds: 16-pin IDC to the output boards. Pin 1 is the triangle on the shroud.\nOdd pins 1-11 GND, 13 = +3V3 (shifter VCCA), 15 = +5V (shifter VCCB); data 1-8 on even pins 2-16\n(same as led-output-board J2 and led-processor-board). 33R series resistors at the Pico end."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7aa9680e-4ec8-5dce-ad7c-23dc93d301ea")
	)
	(text "OUT1: GP0-7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d4f5abaa-6bbd-503f-8e5a-57af602b7b63")
	)
