	(text "J4: debug UART, moved off GP0/1 so the outputs get GP0-15.\nJ5 and J7: I2C0 with 10k pull-ups, for a small display or a sensor. J5 is a pin header in the\norder of the common 4-pin OLED modules; J7 is a STEMMA QT / Qwiic socket for ready-made cables.\nMind the order: SCL and SDA swap places between the two."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
